    'dva-3-981': 'Practice dummies never check your guild pass, so they can\'t tell you it\'s expired. Run a real dungeon in a test world before the big raid.',
    'dva-3-982': 'No internet in the training hall? Bring your own pocket copy of the item vault, start it fresh each session, and point your code at it.',
    'dva-3-983': 'The hero\'s already out in the world, just with no quest giver yet. sam remote invoke hands the quest scroll straight to that hero and reads back the report.',
