    'dva-3-985': 'Sharing one castle gate (an export) means every town uses the same gate. Each town wants its own, so keep one blueprint and have each town build from it.',
    'dva-3-986': 'Explain is the narrator, Fix is the healer and Generate tests is the sparring partner. To tidy a messy spell into something readable, call the Refactor sage.',
    'dva-2-450': 'The vault never keeps your key, so every time you open the chest you must hold the key up yourself. A link pasted in a browser can\'t hold the key, so only a script that brings it along gets in.',
    'dva-2-451': 'Twin swords share the same blade, but each one has its own sheath. Sheathing the sword in one town leaves its twin drawn in the other, so you have to sheathe both.',
