    'dva-2-453': 'A new guild pass takes a while to reach every gate guard. Show the receipt you got when the pass was made, and any guard lets you in right away.',
    'dva-2-454': 'Swapping a gem from one lock to another is its own spell, with its own two permission slips: one for taking out, one for putting in. Having the open and close spells isn\'t enough.',
